       this key ABSENT still produced
           build/ios/iphoneos/Runner.app/Frameworks/App.framework
       carrying MinimumOSVersion 13.0 — Flutter injects it from
       IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET at build time. The real sources of truth are
       IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET = 13.0 in project.pbxproj and
       `platform :ios, '13.0'` in the Podfile; both are set.

       So if it disappears again, check the built framework before chasing it. -->
